      "slug": "ed-after-y",
      "title": "Past tense after y: study → studied, play → played",
      "rule_type": "language_rule",
      "short_explanation": "If a verb ends in consonant + y, change y to i and add -ed: study → studied. If it ends in vowel + y, just add -ed: play → played.",
      "tts_text": "After a consonant, change y to i before ed. After a vowel, keep y.",
      "mnemonic": "Consonant plus y: say bye to y. Vowel plus y: keep it.",
